  title: My Gloomy Space Cafeteria README
  sections:
  - heading: Welcome to MGSC, your favorite Steam project !
    text: This readme and others like it should provide you with enough information
      to get started.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Readmes
    text: You will perhaps encounter other Readme's like this one. They are meant
      to help you to understand how to use assets, hierarchy, and other stuff. If
      you do not understand or if you do not agree with Readme's, don't hesitate
      to share it with the group !
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: How to make your own readme ?
    text: You are more than welcome to contribute to the documentation of this project
      ! Simply take this readme, and copy-paste it elsewhere. Make sure to rename
      it to "Readme". Then, click on the three dots at the top right of this inspector,
      then switch to debug mode. You can then change the title, icon, content, links
      etc. Happy writing !!
    linkText: 
    url: 
